
This is Global War 2.21e, a strategical multi-user warfare online game
for all Amiga bulletin boards that are able to run CLI programs.

Changes since last version:

Introducing new features; the Virusbomb and The Plague.
New Special effects menu.
Improved game information on the tactical briefing screen.
Improved file I/O operations.
Updated the game documentation (GW.doc).
Beta tested for a long period, all reported bugs fixed.
And more...

